<main><section class="ev-events ev-events-first" id="upcoming"><div class="ev-wrap"><div class="ev-head ev-head-intro"><div class="ev-eyebrow">UPCOMING EVENTS</div><h1>Meet ZKTeco WFM at Upcoming Events</h1><p>Meet us where workforce technology is moving forward. From Workday-connected time collection to complete technology for HCM and WFM platforms, each event is an opportunity to experience the ZKTeco WFM ecosystem in the context that matters to you.</p></div><div class="ev-grid">
<article class="ev-card"><div class="ev-card-media"><img src="assets/workday-rising-usa-las-vegas-2026.png" alt="Las Vegas — Workday Rising, October 12–15, 2026"/></div><div class="ev-card-top"></div><div class="ev-card-body"><div class="ev-type">WORKDAY CUSTOMERS · USA</div><h3>Workday Rising 2026</h3><div class="ev-meta">October 12–15, 2026 · Las Vegas · The Venetian Resort and Caesars Forum</div><div class="ev-position">Time &amp; Labor Data Collection. Built for Workday.</div><p>See how Workday customers can modernize the point where time and labor data begins. Experience the Ultima Series, TimeTrack and CirrusDCS working together to capture trusted employee punches, apply workforce controls and deliver data into Workday. Visit Booth C12 for live end-to-end demonstrations.</p><div class="ev-actions"><a class="ev-btn primary meet" href="contact?event=workday-rising-usa-2026">Meet ZKTeco WFM →</a><a class="ev-btn outline" href="https://rising.workday.com/us.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Event Website ↗</a><a class="ev-btn dark" href="https://rising.workday.com/us.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Register ↗</a></div></div></article>
<article class="ev-card hr"><div class="ev-card-media"><img src="assets/hr-tech-2026-mandalay-bay-las-vegas.jpg" alt="Mandalay Bay, Las Vegas — HR Tech 2026, October 20–22, 2026"/></div><div class="ev-card-top"></div><div class="ev-card-body"><div class="ev-type">SOFTWARE PARTNERS + HR TECHNOLOGY</div><h3>HR Tech 2026</h3><div class="ev-meta">October 20–22, 2026 · Las Vegas · Mandalay Bay</div><div class="ev-position">The Workforce Data Collection Company.</div><p>HR technology keeps advancing. Workforce data collection should too. Explore how enterprise time clocks, TimeTrack, CirrusConnect, cloud services and flexible punch experiences create a complete data collection layer for HCM and WFM platforms—from the employee punch to the system that depends on it.</p><div class="ev-actions"><a class="ev-btn primary meet" href="contact?event=hr-tech-2026">Meet ZKTeco WFM →</a><a class="ev-btn outline" href="https://www.hrtechnologyconference.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Event Website ↗</a><a class="ev-btn dark" href="https://www.hrtechnologyconference.com/register" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Register ↗</a></div></div></article>
<article class="ev-card"><div class="ev-card-media"><img src="assets/workday-rising-emea-barcelona-2026.png" alt="Barcelona — Workday Rising EMEA, 17–19 November 2026"/></div><div class="ev-card-top"></div><div class="ev-card-body"><div class="ev-type">WORKDAY CUSTOMERS · EMEA</div><h3>Workday Rising EMEA 2026</h3><div class="ev-meta">17–19 November 2026 · Barcelona · Fira Gran Via</div><div class="ev-position">Workday Time Collection. Built to Scale.</div><p>For organizations operating Workday across countries, locations and workforce environments, time collection cannot be one-size-fits-all. See how Ultima, TimeTrack and CirrusDCS create a consistent Workday-connected foundation with flexible devices, credentials, connectivity and punch experiences built to scale.</p><div class="ev-actions"><a class="ev-btn primary meet" href="contact?event=workday-rising-emea-2026">Meet ZKTeco WFM →</a><a class="ev-btn outline" href="https://rising.workday.com/emea.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Event Website ↗</a><a class="ev-btn dark" href="https://rising.workday.com/emea.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Register ↗</a></div></div></article>
<article class="ev-card hr"><div class="ev-card-media"><img src="assets/hr-tech-europe-amsterdam-2027.jpg" alt="Amsterdam — HR Tech Europe, 21–22 April 2027, RAI Amsterdam"/></div><div class="ev-card-top"></div><div class="ev-card-body"><div class="ev-type">SOFTWARE PARTNERS + HR TECHNOLOGY · EUROPE</div><h3>HR Tech Europe 2027</h3><div class="ev-meta">21–22 April 2027 · Amsterdam · RAI Amsterdam</div><div class="ev-position">Build Less. Offer More. Grow Faster.</div><p>For HCM and WFM software companies, adding time-clock technology should not mean building hardware, device software, cloud connectivity and lifecycle operations from scratch. See how ZKTeco WFM provides the technology behind the clock so partners can Build Less. Offer More. Grow Faster.</p><div class="ev-actions"><a class="ev-btn primary meet" href="contact?event=hr-tech-europe-2027">Meet ZKTeco WFM →</a><a class="ev-btn outline" href="https://www.hrtechnologyeurope.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Event Website ↗</a><a class="ev-btn dark" href="https://www.hrtechnologyeurope.com/register" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Register ↗</a></div></div></article>
<article class="ev-card hr"><div class="ev-card-media"><img src="assets/hr-technologies-uk-london-2027.jpg" alt="London — HR Technologies UK, 5–6 May 2027, ExCeL London"/></div><div class="ev-card-top"></div><div class="ev-card-body"><div class="ev-type">SOFTWARE PARTNERS + HR TECHNOLOGY · UK</div><h3>HR Technologies UK 2027</h3><div class="ev-meta">5–6 May 2027 · London · ExCeL London</div><div class="ev-position">Workforce Data Collection for the Front Line.</div><p>HR transformation reaches beyond the core platform to the moment employees actually interact with it. Explore enterprise time clocks, mobile, web, kiosk and IVR experiences that help HR, payroll and IT teams collect dependable workforce data across frontline, distributed and complex work environments.</p><div class="ev-actions"><a class="ev-btn primary meet" href="contact?event=hr-technologies-uk-2027">Meet ZKTeco WFM →</a><a class="ev-btn outline" href="https://www.hrtechnologies.co.uk/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Event Website ↗</a><a class="ev-btn dark" href="https://www.hrtechnologies.co.uk/visiting/register-interest" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Register Interest ↗</a></div></div></article>
</div></div></section>
